WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:14.203
Violet laughed.

2
00:00:14.884 --> 00:00:17.564
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl!

3
00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.005
I'm going to the concert at the park.

4
00:00:20.325 --> 00:00:22.866
It will be my biggest performance yet."

5
00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:27.947
Roxy stood there, holding the steel beam.

6
00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.528
She felt as if she was in a dream.

7
00:00:35.228 --> 00:00:35.969
"Rocket Girl!"

8
00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:36.870
a woman cried.

9
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:37.690
"Wake up!"

10
00:00:39.111 --> 00:00:41.193
But Roxy couldn't move or think clearly.

11
00:00:42.254 --> 00:00:43.375
Her arms felt weak.

12
00:00:44.476 --> 00:00:47.378
The beam fell from her hands and slammed onto the ground.

13
00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:52.182
Bang! Roxy blinked and woke up.

14
00:00:52.202 --> 00:00:54.464
"W-what's going on?"

15
00:00:54.764 --> 00:00:55.285
she asked.

16
00:00:56.546 --> 00:00:59.128
"You were hypnotized," the woman said.

17
00:00:59.148 --> 00:01:03.552
"There was a violinist, and she—" "I remember now!"

18
00:01:03.988 --> 00:01:07.409
Roxy also remembered what Violet had said about the concert at the park.

19
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.630
She flew into a store.

20
00:01:12.831 --> 00:01:15.311
A minute later she shot toward Metro City Park.

21
00:01:18.212 --> 00:01:21.273
Violet stood onstage, running her bow across the violin's strings.

22
00:01:22.253 --> 00:01:23.754
Members of the orchestra sat still.

23
00:01:24.674 --> 00:01:26.194
They were all staring into space.

24
00:01:27.315 --> 00:01:29.035
Audience members walked toward the stage.

25
00:01:29.915 --> 00:01:31.656
They held out their wallets and jewelry.

26
00:01:33.936 --> 00:01:34.777
Violet laughed.

27
00:01:35.757 --> 00:01:38.418
"I'm going to be rich, rich, rich!"

28
00:01:39.959 --> 00:01:41.480
Roxy watched from far away.

29
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.881
"I'm glad I bought these earplugs."

30
00:01:45.982 --> 00:01:47.262
She popped them into her ears.

31
00:01:47.282 --> 00:01:51.204
"Your big performance is over, Violet!"

32
00:01:51.624 --> 00:01:53.045
Roxy darted toward the stage.

33
00:01:53.065 --> 00:01:55.246
"Rocket Girl!"

34
00:01:55.726 --> 00:01:56.546
Violet snapped.

35
00:01:57.327 --> 00:01:59.488
She started to play a new song on her violin.

36
00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:04.982
"Play all you want," Roxy said.

37
00:02:05.002 --> 00:02:07.343
"I'm wearing earplugs!"

38
00:02:08.724 --> 00:02:10.445
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

39
00:02:11.145 --> 00:02:14.547
Whiz-hoo! Violet leaped out of the way.

40
00:02:15.247 --> 00:02:18.209
The laser beams hit a French horn, which melted into a puddle.

41
00:02:18.229 --> 00:02:20.851
"Yikes!" Roxy cried.

42
00:02:20.871 --> 00:02:22.952
"How can I stop Violet?

43
00:02:23.632 --> 00:02:25.673
I can't use my eye laser beams again.

44
00:02:26.094 --> 00:02:27.194
Someone might get hurt."

45
00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:33.621
Roxy remembered what Mara had said: "Temperature affects musical instruments."

46
00:02:35.002 --> 00:02:37.063
Roxy blew her freeze breath at Violet.

47
00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:43.006
Whoosh! Violet made a face.

48
00:02:43.787 --> 00:02:46.308
"My violin is going out of tune!"

49
00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.271
Roxy zoomed over and grabbed the violin.

50
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:55.313
"Your performance has been canceled, Violet!"

51
00:02:57.434 --> 00:02:58.575
Audience members woke up.

52
00:02:59.275 --> 00:03:00.776
They looked around in surprise.

53
00:03:02.984 --> 00:03:03.685
"What's going on?"

54
00:03:04.105 --> 00:03:04.806
a man shouted.

55
00:03:04.826 --> 00:03:07.267
"Why am I on the stage?"

56
00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:10.650
"Look!" Terrell cried.

57
00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.791
"Rocket Girl is onstage!

58
00:03:13.712 --> 00:03:15.173
Is she playing the violin?"

59
00:03:18.215 --> 00:03:21.178
Roxy grabbed Violet's wrist and flew her to Police Headquarters.

60
00:03:26.321 --> 00:03:26.862
said Mara.

61
00:03:26.882 --> 00:03:29.664
"You missed the beginning of the concert."

62
00:03:31.004 --> 00:03:32.705
Roxy sat down next to her friends.

63
00:03:34.005 --> 00:03:35.806
Up onstage, the orchestra played.

64
00:03:37.927 --> 00:03:39.307
Terrell leaned toward Roxy.

65
00:03:39.327 --> 00:03:43.028
"You were wrong about Rocket Girl," he whispered.

66
00:03:43.048 --> 00:03:45.189
"She plays the violin."

67
00:03:45.209 --> 00:03:48.891
"Shh," Roxy whispered with a smile.

68
00:03:48.911 --> 00:03:51.471
"Let's just enjoy the music."
